  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="58">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 58</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="58" corresp="#wit-g-a">Gif hwa ciningces borh abrece, gebete þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> mid V pundan.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="58" corresp="#wit-a">Gif hwa cyninges borh abrece, gebe[te] þæt mid fif pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="58" corresp="#wit-q">Si quis plegium (pacem) regis frangat, emendet V libras.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="58" corresp="#wit-b">Be borhbryce. Gif hwa kynincges borh abrece, gebete þæt mid V pundum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-b">Concerning the violation of protection. If anyone violates the king's protection, he shall pay £5 as compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#whitelock">If anyone violates the king’s surety, he is to compensate for it with five pounds.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">(Vom Bruch der Schutzgewähr. B) Wenn einer des Königs Schutzgewähr verletzt, büsse er das mit 5 Pfund [dem Könige].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">(Of the breach of protection. B) If anyone violates the king's protection, let him atone for it with 5 pounds [to the king].</ab>
        <note type="editorial">A reads ‘gebe’; Liebermann supplies [te]. Liebermann compares Af 3.</note>
        <note type="translator" source="#whitelock">from Alfred 3</note>
      </div>
    </body>
